{"title":"Reasoning Super Practice — Mock #11","duration_min":20.0,"questions":[{"q_en":"<p>What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation if '+' and '&#8722;' are interchanged and ' X ' and '&div;' are interchanged?</p><p>16 &div; 4 + 8  X  8 &#8722; 4 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '&#8722;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 'X' &#2324;&#2352; '&div;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>16 &div; 4 + 8 X 8 &#8722; 4 = ?</p>","options_en":["11","67","42","36"],"options_hi":["11","67","42","36"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p>16 &div; 4 + 8  X  8 &#8722; 4 = ?</p><p>After interchanging '+' and '&#8722;' and ' X ' and '&div;'</p><p>16  X  4  -  8 &div; 8 + 4 = ?</p><p>16  X  4  -  1 + 4 = ?</p><p>64  -  1 + 4 = ?</p><p>64 + 3 = ?</p><p>? = <b>67</b></p>","solution_hi":"<p>16 &div; 4 + 8  X  8 &#8722; 4 = ?</p><p>After interchanging '+' and '&#8722;' and ' X ' and '&div;'</p><p>16  X  4  -  8 &div; 8 + 4 = ?</p><p>16  X  4  -  1 + 4 = ?</p><p>64  -  1 + 4 = ?</p><p>64 + 3 = ?</p><p>? = <b>67</b></p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which of the following operations should be interchanged to make the following equation correct?</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p>","options_en":["+ and &div;","&div; and  -","&#8722; and +","X  and  -"],"options_hi":["+ and &div;","&div; and  -","&#8722; and +","X  and  -"],"answer":1,"solution_en":"<p>Option (a): + and &div;</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging + and &div;</p><p>12 &div; 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 + 2 = 22</p><p>1  -  4  X  4 + 2 = 22</p><p>1  -  16 + 12 = 22</p><p>1  -  4 = 22</p><p>-3 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (a) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (b): &div; and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging &div; and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &div; 4  X  4  -  2 = 22</p><p>12 + 12  -  2 = 22</p><p>24  -  2 = 22</p><p><b>22 = 22</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>So, <b>option (b)</b> is correct.</p><p>Option (c): &#8722; and +</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging &#8722; and +</p><p>12  -  12 + 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>12  -  12 + 8 = 22</p><p>12  -  4 = 22</p><p>8 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (c) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (d):  X  and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging  X  and  - </p><p>12 + 12  X  4  -  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>12 + 12  X  4  -  2 = 22</p><p>12 + 48  -  2 = 22</p><p>60  -  2 = 22</p><p>58 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Option (a): + and &div;</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging + and &div;</p><p>12 &div; 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 + 2 = 22</p><p>1  -  4  X  4 + 2 = 22</p><p>1  -  16 + 12 = 22</p><p>1  -  4 = 22</p><p>-3 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (a) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (b): &div; and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging &div; and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &div; 4  X  4  -  2 = 22</p><p>12 + 12  -  2 = 22</p><p>24  -  2 = 22</p><p><b>22 = 22</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>So, <b>option (b)</b> is correct.</p><p>Option (c): &#8722; and +</p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging &#8722; and +</p><p>12  -  12 + 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>12  -  12 + 8 = 22</p><p>12  -  4 = 22</p><p>8 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (c) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (d):  X  and  - </p><p>12 + 12 &#8722; 4  X  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>After interchanging  X  and  - </p><p>12 + 12  X  4  -  4 &div; 2 = 22</p><p>12 + 12  X  4  -  2 = 22</p><p>12 + 48  -  2 = 22</p><p>60  -  2 = 22</p><p>58 &#8800; 22</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>So, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which two numbers (not digits) should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p><p>15 + 5  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 16  X  3 = 101</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; (&#2309;&#2306;&#2325; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319; &#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>15 + 5 x 8 - 72 &div; 4 + 16 x 3 = 101</p>","options_en":["5 and 4","15 and 16","5 and 3","8 and 4"],"options_hi":["5 &#2324;&#2352; 4","15 &#2324;&#2352; 16","5 &#2324;&#2352; 3","8 &#2324;&#2352; 4"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>We have the equation as:-</p><p>15 + 5  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>On checking each option one by one we get:-</p><p>I. 5 and 4</p><p>15 + 4  X  8  -  72 &div; 5 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 32  -  14.4 + 48 = 101</p><p>95  -  14.4 = 101</p><p>80.6 &#8800; 101</p><p>II. 15 and 16</p><p>16 + 5  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 15  X  3 = 101</p><p>16 + 5  X  8  -  18 + 15  X  3 = 101</p><p>16 + 40  -  18 + 45 = 101</p><p>101  -  18 = 101</p><p>83 &#8800; 101</p><p>III. 5 and 3</p><p>15 + 3  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 16  X  5 = 101</p><p>15 + 3  X  8  -  18 + 16  X  5 = 101</p><p>15 + 24  -  18 + 80 = 101</p><p>119  -  18 = 101</p><p>IV. 8 and 4</p><p>15 + 5  X  4  -  72 &div; 8 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 5  X  4  -  9 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 20  -  9 + 48 = 101</p><p>83  -  9 = 101</p><p>74 &#8800; 101</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>We have the equation as:-</p><p>15 + 5  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>On checking each option one by one we get:-</p><p>I. 5 and 4</p><p>15 + 4  X  8  -  72 &div; 5 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 32  -  14.4 + 48 = 101</p><p>95  -  14.4 = 101</p><p>80.6 &#8800; 101</p><p>II. 15 and 16</p><p>16 + 5  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 15  X  3 = 101</p><p>16 + 5  X  8  -  18 + 15  X  3 = 101</p><p>16 + 40  -  18 + 45 = 101</p><p>101  -  18 = 101</p><p>83 &#8800; 101</p><p>III. 5 and 3</p><p>15 + 3  X  8  -  72 &div; 4 + 16  X  5 = 101</p><p>15 + 3  X  8  -  18 + 16  X  5 = 101</p><p>15 + 24  -  18 + 80 = 101</p><p>119  -  18 = 101</p><p>IV. 8 and 4</p><p>15 + 5  X  4  -  72 &div; 8 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 5  X  4  -  9 + 16  X  3 = 101</p><p>15 + 20  -  9 + 48 = 101</p><p>83  -  9 = 101</p><p>74 &#8800; 101</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the following equation correct?</p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5  -  168  X  3 = 283</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5 - 168 X 3 = 283</p>","options_en":["-  and +","-  and  X","&div; and  X","+ and &div;"],"options_hi":["-  and +","-  and  X","&div; and  X","+ and &div;"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>We have the equation as:-</p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>On checking each option by interchanging signs , we get:-</p><p>I. &#8722; and +</p><p>139 - 40 &div; 5 + 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>139 - 8 + 504 = 283</p><p>643 - 8 = 283 </p><p>635 &#8800; 283</p><p>II. &#8722; and  X </p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5  X  168 - 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 8  X  168 - 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 1344 - 3 = 283</p><p>1480 &#8800; 283</p><p>III. &div; and  X </p><p>139 + 40  X  5 &#8722; 168 &div; 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 40  X  5 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>139 + 200 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>339 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>283 = 283</p><p>IV. + and &div;</p><p>139 &div; 40 + 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>3.475 + 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>3.475 + 5 &#8722; 504 = 283</p><p>8.475 &#8722; 504 = 283</p><p>-495.525 &#8800; 283</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>We have the equation as:-</p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>On checking each option by interchanging signs , we get:-</p><p>I. &#8722; and +</p><p>139 - 40 &div; 5 + 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>139 - 8 + 504 = 283</p><p>643 - 8 = 283 </p><p>635 &#8800; 283</p><p>II. &#8722; and  X </p><p>139 + 40 &div; 5  X  168 - 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 8  X  168 - 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 1344 - 3 = 283</p><p>1480 &#8800; 283</p><p>III. &div; and  X </p><p>139 + 40  X  5 &#8722; 168 &div; 3 = 283</p><p>139 + 40  X  5 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>139 + 200 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>339 &#8722; 56 = 283</p><p>283 = 283</p><p>IV. + and &div;</p><p>139 &div; 40 + 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>3.475 + 5 &#8722; 168  X  3 = 283</p><p>3.475 + 5 &#8722; 504 = 283</p><p>8.475 &#8722; 504 = 283</p><p>-495.525 &#8800; 283</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What will come in the place of the question mark (?) in the following equation if '+' and ' X ' are interchanged and '&#8722;' and '&div;' are interchanged?</p><p>95  -  19  X  4 + 6 &div; 16 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; 'X' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; '&#8722;' &#2324;&#2352; '&div;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>95 - 19 X 4 + 6 &div; 16 = ?</p>","options_en":["13","12","14","11"],"options_hi":["13","12","14","11"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>Replace each operator as follows:</p><p>&#8226; \" - \" becomes \"&div;\"</p><p>&#8226; \" X \" becomes \"+\"</p><p>&#8226; \"+\" becomes \" X \"</p><p>&#8226; \"&div;\" becomes \"&#8722;\"</p><p>Thus, the expression becomes:</p><p>&#8195;95 &div; 19 + 4  X  6 &#8722; 16</p><p>Now compute step by step:</p><p>&#8226; 95 &div; 19 = 5</p><p>&#8226; 4  X  6 = 24</p><p>Then, 5 + 24 = 29 and finally 29 &#8722; 16 = 13.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Replace each operator as follows:</p><p>&#8226; \" - \" becomes \"&div;\"</p><p>&#8226; \" X \" becomes \"+\"</p><p>&#8226; \"+\" becomes \" X \"</p><p>&#8226; \"&div;\" becomes \"&#8722;\"</p><p>Thus, the expression becomes:</p><p>&#8195;95 &div; 19 + 4  X  6 &#8722; 16</p><p>Now compute step by step:</p><p>&#8226; 95 &div; 19 = 5</p><p>&#8226; 4  X  6 = 24</p><p>Then, 5 + 24 = 29 and finally 29 &#8722; 16 = 13.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if '+' and ' - ' are interchanged and ' X ' and '&div;' are Interchanged?</p><p>2736  X  8  -  55 + 105 &div; 2 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;, &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '-' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 'X' &#2324;&#2352; '&div;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>2736 X 8 - 55 + 105 &div; 2 = ?</p>","options_en":["127","137","187","177"],"options_hi":["127","137","187","177"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>Apply the swaps:</p><p>&#8226; \" X \" becomes \"&div;\" and \"&div;\" becomes \" X \"</p><p>&#8226; \"+\" and \" - \" interchange</p><p>Thus, the new expression is:</p><p>&#8195;2736 &div; 8 + 55 &#8722; 105  X  2</p><p>Calculate step by step:</p><p>&#8226; 2736 &div; 8 = 342</p><p>&#8226; 105  X  2 = 210</p><p>Then, 342 + 55 = 397 and finally 397 &#8722; 210 = 187.</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Apply the swaps:</p><p>&#8226; \" X \" becomes \"&div;\" and \"&div;\" becomes \" X \"</p><p>&#8226; \"+\" and \" - \" interchange</p><p>Thus, the new expression is:</p><p>&#8195;2736 &div; 8 + 55 &#8722; 105  X  2</p><p>Calculate step by step:</p><p>&#8226; 2736 &div; 8 = 342</p><p>&#8226; 105  X  2 = 210</p><p>Then, 342 + 55 = 397 and finally 397 &#8722; 210 = 187.</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What will come in the place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if '+' and '&#8722;' are interchanged and ' X ' and '&div;' are interchanged?</p><p>98 &div; 7 + 288  X  2 &#8722; 144  X  3 &#8722; 152 &div; 2 + 120 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;, &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '&#8722;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 'X' &#2324;&#2352; '&div;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>98 &div; 7 + 288 X 2 &#8722; 144 X 3 &#8722; 152 &div; 2 + 120 = ?</p>","options_en":["774","671","632","743"],"options_hi":["774","671","632","743"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>98 &div; 7 + 288  X  2 &#8722; 144  X  3 &#8722; 152 &div; 2 + 120 = ?</p><p>After interchange:</p><p>98 x 7 - 288 &div; 2 + 144 &div; 3 + 152 x 2 - 120 = ?</p><p>686  -  144 + 48 + 304  -  120 = ?</p><p>542 + 48 + 184 = ? </p><p>? = 774</p><p>So, option (1) is the correct answer. </p>","solution_hi":"<p>98 &div; 7 + 288  X  2 &#8722; 144  X  3 &#8722; 152 &div; 2 + 120 = ?</p><p>After interchange:</p><p>98 x 7 - 288 &div; 2 + 144 &div; 3 + 152 x 2 - 120 = ?</p><p>686  -  144 + 48 + 304  -  120 = ?</p><p>542 + 48 + 184 = ? </p><p>? = 774</p><p>So, option (1) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>If + means -, -means x, x means &div;, and &div; means +, what will be the value of the following expression?</p><p>5 &div; 5 + 5  -  10 x 10 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; + &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, - &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; x &#2361;&#2376;, x &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &div; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>5 &div; 5 + 5 - 10 x 10 = ?</p>","options_en":["15","4","5","10"],"options_hi":["15","4","5","10"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>5 &div; 5 + 5  -  10 x 10 = ?</p><p>After interchange of signs:</p><p>5 + 5 - 5 x 10 &div; 10 = ?</p><p>Using BODMAS:</p><p>5 + 5  -  5 x 1 = ?</p><p>10 - 5 = ?</p><p>? = 5</p><p>So, option (c) is correct.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>5 &div; 5 + 5  -  10 x 10 = ?</p><p>After interchange of signs:</p><p>5 + 5 - 5 x 10 &div; 10 = ?</p><p>Using BODMAS:</p><p>5 + 5  -  5 x 1 = ?</p><p>10 - 5 = ?</p><p>? = 5</p><p>So, option (c) is correct.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Select the correct combination of mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs and balance the given equation.</p><p>21*3*36*2*23=68</p>","q_hi":"<p>* &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2