2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>96 &div; 8 &#8722; 3 X 6 + 32 = 24</p>","options_en":["6 and 8","3 and 32","3 and 8","8 and 32"],"options_hi":["6 &#2324;&#2352; 8","3 &#2324;&#2352; 32","3 &#2324;&#2352; 8","8 &#2324;&#2352; 32"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>Option (a):</p><p>96 &div; 6 &#8722; 3  X  8 + 32 = 24</p><p>16  -  24 + 32 = 24</p><p>24 is equal to 24</p><p>Option (b):</p><p>96 &div; 8 &#8722; 32  X  6 + 3 = 24</p><p>12  -  192 + 3 = 24</p><p>-177 is not equal to 24</p><p>Option (c):</p><p>96 &div; 3 &#8722; 8  X  6 + 32 = 24</p><p>32  -  48 + 32 = 24</p><p>16 is not equal to 24</p><p>Option (d):</p><p>96 &div; 32 &#8722; 3  X  6 + 8 = 24</p><p>3  -  18 + 8 = 24</p><p>-7 is not equal to 24</p><p>So, option (a) is the correct answer. </p>","solution_hi":"<p>Option (a):</p><p>96 &div; 6 &#8722; 3  X  8 + 32 = 24</p><p>16  -  24 + 32 = 24</p><p>24 is equal to 24</p><p>Option (b):</p><p>96 &div; 8 &#8722; 32  X  6 + 3 = 24</p><p>12  -  192 + 3 = 24</p><p>-177 is not equal to 24</p><p>Option (c):</p><p>96 &div; 3 &#8722; 8  X  6 + 32 = 24</p><p>32  -  48 + 32 = 24</p><p>16 is not equal to 24</p><p>Option (d):</p><p>96 &div; 32 &#8722; 3  X  6 + 8 = 24</p><p>3  -  18 + 8 = 24</p><p>-7 is not equal to 24</p><p>So, option (a) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>If '+' means '&div;', ' X ' means '&#8722;', '&div;' means '+' and '&#8722;' means ' X ', then what will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation?</p><p>91 + 13 &#8722; 8  X  37 &div; 44 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&div;', ' X ' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#8722;', '&div;' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '&#8722;' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; ' X ' &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344;&#2357;&#2366;&#2330;&#2325; &#2330;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2361; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;?</p><p>91 + 13 &#8722; 8 X 37 &div; 44 = ?</p>","options_en":["67","59","63","51"],"options_hi":["67","59","63","51"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>91 + 13 &#8722; 8  X  37 &div; 44 = ?</p><p>After interchange:</p><p>91 &div; 13 x 8 - 37 + 44 = ?</p><p>7 x 8 + 7 = ?</p><p>? = 56 + 7 = 63</p><p>So, option (c) is the correct answer. </p>","solution_hi":"<p>91 + 13 &#8722; 8  X  37 &div; 44 = ?</p><p>After interchange:</p><p>91 &div; 13 x 8 - 37 + 44 = ?</p><p>7 x 8 + 7 = ?</p><p>? = 56 + 7 = 63</p><p>So, option (c) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p><p>588 &div; 28  X  32 + 72  -  160 = 760</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>588 &div; 28 X 32 + 72 - 160 = 760</p>","options_en":["-  and +","&div; and  -","+ and  X","&div; and +"],"options_hi":["- &#2324;&#2352; +","&div; &#2324;&#2352; -","+ &#2324;&#2352; X","&div; &#2324;&#2352; +"],"answer":0,"solution_en":"<p>Option (a): 588 &div; 28  X  32  -  72 + 160 = 21  X  32  -  72 + 160 = 672  -  72 + 160 = 760</p><p>Option (b): 588  -  28  X  32 + 72 &div; 160 = 588  -  28  X  32 + 0.45 = 588  -  896 + 0.45 = -307.55</p><p>Option (c): 588 &div; 28 + 32  X  72  -  160 = 21 + 32  X  72  -  160 = 21 + 2304  -  160 = 2165</p><p>Option (d): 588 + 28  X  32 &div; 72  -  160 = 588 + 28  X  (4/9)  -  160 = 588 + (112/9)  -  160 = 440.44</p><p>Hence, option (a) is correct.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Option (a): 588 &div; 28  X  32  -  72 + 160 = 21  X  32  -  72 + 160 = 672  -  72 + 160 = 760</p><p>Option (b): 588  -  28  X  32 + 72 &div; 160 = 588  -  28  X  32 + 0.45 = 588  -  896 + 0.45 = -307.55</p><p>Option (c): 588 &div; 28 + 32  X  72  -  160 = 21 + 32  X  72  -  160 = 21 + 2304  -  160 = 2165</p><p>Option (d): 588 + 28  X  32 &div; 72  -  160 = 588 + 28  X  (4/9)  -  160 = 588 + (112/9)  -  160 = 440.44</p><p>Hence, option (a) is correct.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What will come in the place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if '+' and '&#8722;' are interchanged and ' X ' and '&div; 'are interchanged?</p><p>304  X  19  -  101 + 23 &div; 5 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;, &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '&#8722;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 'X' &#2324;&#2352; '&div; ' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>304 X 19 - 101 + 23 &div; 5 = ?</p>","options_en":["21","12","2","6"],"options_hi":["21","12","2","6"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>&#183; Replace '+' with '&#8722;',</p><p>&#183; '&#8722;' with '+', and </p><p>&#183; ' X ' with '&div;', and</p><p>&#183; '&div;' with ' X '.</p><p>Step 1: Rewrite the expression with the changes</p><p>The original expression is:</p><p>304 X 19&#8722;101+23&div;5=?</p><p>After replacing the operators:</p><p>304&div;19+101&#8722;23 X 5=?</p><p>Step 2: Follow the order of operations (BODMAS)</p><p>16+101-115 =2</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>&#183; Replace '+' with '&#8722;',</p><p>&#183; '&#8722;' with '+', and </p><p>&#183; ' X ' with '&div;', and</p><p>&#183; '&div;' with ' X '.</p><p>Step 1: Rewrite the expression with the changes</p><p>The original expression is:</p><p>304 X 19&#8722;101+23&div;5=?</p><p>After replacing the operators:</p><p>304&div;19+101&#8722;23 X 5=?</p><p>Step 2: Follow the order of operations (BODMAS)</p><p>16+101-115 =2</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25},{"q_en":"<p>What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation, if '+' and ' - ' are interchanged and ' X ' and '&div;' are interchanged?</p><p>164  -  173 &div; 110 + 140  X  5 = ?</p>","q_hi":"<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; (?) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;, &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '+' &#2324;&#2352; '-' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; 'X' &#2324;&#2352; '&div;' &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2352;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;?</p><p>164 - 173 &div; 110 + 140 X 5 = ?</p>","options_en":["19616","11619","19166","11916"],"options_hi":["19616","11619","19166","11916"],"answer":2,"solution_en":"<p>Given equation:</p><p>164&#8722;173&div;110+140 X 5=?</p><p>Interchanges:</p><p>1) + becomes &#8722;</p><p>2) &#8722; becomes +</p><p>3)  X  becomes &div;</p><p>4) &div; becomes  X </p><p>Applying the interchanges:</p><p>164+173 X 110&#8722;140&div;5=?</p><p>Step 1: Follow BODMAS (Order of operations)</p><p>1) First, solve multiplication and division:</p><p>173 X 110=19030</p><p>140&div;5=28</p><p>2) Substitute back into the equation:</p><p>164+19030&#8722;28</p><p>Step 2: Solve addition and subtraction:</p><p>1) Add:</p><p>164+19030=19194</p><p>2) Subtract:</p><p>19194&#8722;28=19166</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","solution_hi":"<p>Given equation:</p><p>164&#8722;173&div;110+140 X 5=?</p><p>Interchanges:</p><p>1) + becomes &#8722;</p><p>2) &#8722; becomes +</p><p>3)  X  becomes &div;</p><p>4) &div; becomes  X </p><p>Applying the interchanges:</p><p>164+173 X 110&#8722;140&div;5=?</p><p>Step 1: Follow BODMAS (Order of operations)</p><p>1) First, solve multiplication and division:</p><p>173 X 110=19030</p><p>140&div;5=28</p><p>2) Substitute back into the equation:</p><p>164+19030&#8722;28</p><p>Step 2: Solve addition and subtraction:</p><p>1) Add:</p><p>164+19030=19194</p><p>2) Subtract:</p><p>19194&#8722;28=19166</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":1.0,"neg":0.25}]}